    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the civil service law, in relation to compensation, benefits\nand other terms and conditions of employment of certain state officers and\nemployees; to authorize funding of joint labor management committees; to\nimplement agreements between the state and an employee organization; making an\nappropriation therefor; and to repeal certain provisions of such law relating\nthereto",
